abstract: >-
  JSBSim is a multi-platform, general purpose
  object-oriented Flight Dynamics Model (FDM) written in
  C++. JSBSim is a research software that can be run as a
  standalone batch-mode flight simulator (no graphical
  displays a.k.a. console mode) for testing and study, or it
  can be integrated with the Unreal engine, FlightGear and
  many other simulation environments.
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite our article in the
  Journal of Open Source Software.
